      "writtenOn": "2022-10-18T13:32:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, we should be mapping/unmapping on the same thread. See https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/591266/2/src/gpu/graphite/Context.cpp for how it might be used.",
